  "zh": "# Python生态加速扩张，RISC-V获官方支持引关注\n\n## AI 与科技\n- **RISC-V获CPython官方支持**：开源芯片架构首次进入主流语言核心生态，意味着未来更多AI应用可能基于RISC-V开发\n- **腾讯发布Hy4预览版**：国内大厂持续加码AI框架迭代，开发者需关注其与现有主流框架的生态差异\n- **Linux获加州年龄验证法豁免**：GPL等开源协议软件不用强制接入身份验证系统，开源社区赢得重要法律胜利\n\n## 技术动态\n- **EVE Online全面迁移Python 3**：经典游戏历时多年完成语言升级，侧面反映企业级Python 2遗产迁移的复杂性\n- **Linux实现iMessage与SMS收发**：长期困扰桌面Linux用户的通讯割裂问题出现开源解决方案\n\n## 环境与社会\n- **西藏吉隆泥石流已致16死546失联**：地震带叠加极端天气，防灾减灾话题再度升温\n- **南极冰川融化释放有毒水银**：科研警告冰川消融可能释放封存的重金属污染物，环境风险被低估",
  "en": "# Python Ecosystem Expands as RISC-V Gains Official CPython Support\n\n## AI & Tech\n- **CPython Officially Supports RISC-V**: The open-source chip architecture enters mainstream language core, signaling potential AI application shifts toward RISC-V\n- **Tencent Releases Hy4 Preview**: Major Chinese tech firms continue AI framework iterations, developers should monitor ecosystem differences\n- **Linux Exempt from California Age-Verification Law**: Software under GPL and open-source licenses won't require mandatory identity verification\n\n## Developer World\n- **EVE Online Completes Python 3 Migration**: Classic game finishes multi-year language upgrade, reflecting enterprise Python 2 legacy complexity\n- **iMessage and SMS Arrive on Linux**: Open-source solution emerges for long-standing desktop communication fragmentation\n\n## Environment & Society\n- **Tibet Landslide: 16 Dead, 546 Missing**: Seismic zone combined with extreme weather renews disaster prevention focus\n- **Antarctic Ice Melts Release Toxic Mercury**: Research warns stored heavy metals may escape as glaciers shrink, environmental risks underestimated"
}